# Layer-2 projects are real Sky projects; everything below is generated by
# `sky build` and must never be committed. The gates build each member from a
# WIPED slate (harness/layer2.rs::clean_build removes these three), so a
# committed artifact could only ever mask the build under test.
sky-out/
.skycache/
.skydeps/
.sky/

# Runtime state produced by running a member (SQLite files, console tokens).
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
